<title>INDIA: Indian April CPI up 9.3 pct yr/yr, government says.</title>
<headline>Indian April CPI up 9.3 pct yr/yr, government says.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's annual rate of inflation as measured by the consumer price index (CPI) was up 9.3 percent in April, the government said.</p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	   April 97 March 96  April 96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	+9.3     +10.0     +9.8</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1982)   354	 351	324</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
